Lastly, as an ISO 27001 and ISO 27701 certified organization since 2023, with our scope including development, delivery, and operations, we have robust security controls in place, including secure software development lifecycle practices, vulnerability management, incident response planning, and segregation of duties. This comprehensive approach ensures that we are well-equipped to handle the sensitive nature of health data while complying with all relevant regulatory requirements.
